OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome bright spells and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers. Showers will be occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy. Feeling rather cool in the
OL,9,Ffresh occasionally strong west or
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers mostly dying out this
OL,13,Fevening although a few lingering along
OL,14,Fthe Argyll coast overnight. Otherwise
OL,15,Fbecoming dry with lengthy clear
OL,16,Fperiods. Strong winds easing.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FMainly dry with variable
OL,19,Famounts of cloud and bright spells.
OL,20,FThe odd shower along the Argyll coast
OL,21,Fat first.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
