OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMainly dry on Thursday before rain
OL,7,Fspreads east later in the afternoon
OL,8,Fand evening. Dry with bright spells on
OL,9,FFriday. Rain likely on Saturday.
